gantt
    title ParkVision Delivery Roadmap (P0-P7)
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    axisFormat %b %Y
    excludes weekends

    section P0 Multi-Tenancy Foundation
    Tenant/Site/Zone/Slot schema (V36+) :p0a, 2026-07-13, 25d
    RLS policies + Hibernate tenant filter :p0b, after p0a, 20d
    RBAC evolution (3 roles) :p0c, after p0b, 15d

    section P1 Edge AI Upgrade
    MOG2 motion gate + YOLOv11 detection :p1a, 2026-07-13, 30d
    PaddleOCR primary OCR + ByteTrack :p1b, after p1a, 30d
    Slot mapping + relocation detection :p1c, after p1b p0c, 20d

    section P2 Event Bus + Realtime
    Outbox pattern + domain events :p2a, after p0b, 20d
    Ingest API + RabbitMQ :p2b, after p2a, 15d
    Redis cache/presence/STOMP relay :p2c, after p2b, 15d

    section P3 Dashboards + Map Designer
    Parking-map polygon designer :p3a, after p0c, 25d
    Live camera view (MJPEG/HLS) :p3b, after p2c, 20d
    Analytics dashboards v1 :p3c, after p3b, 15d

    section P4 AI Chatbot
    Tenant-scoped tool APIs :p4a, after p2b, 20d
    Ollama/Qwen chatbot integration :p4b, after p4a, 25d

    section P5 Billing + Mobile
    Stripe subscriptions + plans :p5a, after p0c, 25d
    React Native/Expo mobile app :p5b, after p5a, 35d

    section P6 Analytics + Notifications
    Notification center :p6a, after p2c, 20d
    Usage metering + deeper analytics :p6b, after p6a p5a, 25d

    section P7 Kubernetes Hardening
    Helm/GitOps platform skeleton :p7a, 2026-08-03, 30d
    HPA + Ingress-NGINX + cert-manager :p7b, after p7a, 25d
    Managed datastores + pre-GA hardening :p7c, after p6b p5b p7b, 30d

    section Launch
    GA readiness review :milestone, m1, after p7c p3c p4b, 0d
